												<r3d:remarks>LP DAAC is a regular member of ISC World Data System. The LP DAAC is one of the Earth Observing System Data and Information System (EOSDIS) Distributed Active Archive Centers (DAACs), part of the ESDIS project. - See more at: https://lpdaac.usgs.gov/data/data-citation-and-policies/#sthash.FWMhhNP9.dpuf
Tools that are primarily designed to search the LP DAAC data holdings and provide access directly to data (https://lpdaac.usgs.gov/tools/data_access): AppEEARS, Data Pool, Earthdata Search,  GDEx, GloVis,  Japan Space Systems Earth Remote Sensing Division, Mercury, MRTWeb, Reverb, Simple Subset Wizard, TerraLook, USGS EarthExplorer. 
List of all tools: https://lpdaac.usgs.gov/tools/</r3d:remarks>
